What's happening inside JVM


Code is compiled into byte code. Byte code can run on any machine by JVM. 

JVM has different components like Garbage Collector, JIT Compiler, etc

JVM Profiler are applications that connect to JVM, extract information from JVM. We can look at output and see how application is performing.

JVM Profiler like Visual VM, JProfiler, New Relic, etc.

